  "id": "47/G",
  "goal": "Assess the Majuli VR tour implementation by understanding its empirical evaluation design and interpreting its presence and cybersickness outcomes.",
  "achieves": "It gives the learner a concrete model for evaluating whether an XR implementation supports immersive experience and comfort, supporting the course aim to understand and implement XR systems with confidence."
 },
